WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.234
Week 29: Relative Clauses and Unknown Referents. define a requirement identify known and unknown people or things connect complex information

2
00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:17.033
Mission brief. Write and defend criteria for an unknown candidate, location, or solution.

3
00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:26.587
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:26.587 --> 00:00:34.475
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:34.475 --> 00:00:43.002
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:43.002 --> 00:01:11.521
Model language. Voy a defender mi propuesta de criterios. — I am going to defend my proposal of criteria. Justifico cada punto con un ejemplo. — I justify each point with an example. Describo el perfil ideal. — I describe the ideal profile. Muestro por qué es la solución ideal. — I show why it's the ideal solution. Argumento de forma convincente. — I argue convincingly.

7
00:01:11.521 --> 00:01:21.441
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
